          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana Koresi omorwoti achigete akonyorekana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti Dario agachiika, na obotuki bogakorwa ase chibuku chiagachire agwo Babiloni ase amagachero ay’oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na agwo Ekibatana, omochie omonene ase orogongo rw’Abamedia, egetabu ekanyorekana eriikire amang’ana aya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase omwaka bw’eritang’ani bw’okogamba kw’omorwoti Koresi, ere akarua ogochika okwo: Enyomba ya Nyasae ere Yerusalemu, tiga eagachwe naende, na oboroso bwaye bokong’igwe, erinde ebing’wanso bionsi, amo na biria bi’ogosambwa, birentwe aroro na koruegwa. Obotambe bw’enyomba eyio gochia igoro bobe obw’amaboko emerongo etano nomo, na obogare bobe obw’amaboko emerongo etano nomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagena aagachwe ase chindwaro isato, na orwaro oromo roagachwe ne chibao. Chibesa chiraakanerwe chirwe ase ekungo y’oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ebikorero bi’enyomba ya Nyasae biroisirie korwa ase chitaabu ne chifeta, biria Nebukadinesaro arusetie korwa ase Hekalu yare Yerusalemu, akabiira Babiloni, bionsi biiranigwe bibekwe naende ime ase Hekalu ere Yerusalemu; mobibeke ime ase enyomba ya Nyasae, kera ekemo aase aye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti Dario okorua ogochika ng’a emeremo egenderere gokorwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Dario akarika riruube iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Bono aye Tatenai, omogabana bw’orogongo rore bosongo y’orooche rw’Eufarati, na Setari‐Bosenai, na abagabana bande abwo mokogamba komo agwo ase orogongo rore bosongo y’orooche roria, inwe beera aare kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe tiga emeremo egokorwa ase enyomba eyio ya Nyasae egenderere; tiga omogabana bw’Abayahudi, na abagaaka babo bagenderere koagacha naende enyomba ya Nyasae aase yarenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amo nayio nachiikire amang’ana morakorere abagaaka abwo b’Abayahudi ase okoagacha enyomba eyio ya Nyasae naende. Emeremo yonsi nigo eraakanerwe korwa ase chitaabu chi’ekungo y’oborwoti, echikorwa ase ebango eria ekorusigwa korwa ase orogongo rore bosongo y’orooche rw’Eufarati; mobe mokobaakana motari goteebana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kende gionsi abakuani bare agwo Yerusalemu baraganie baegwe. Kera rituko nigo baraegwe chieri chinsae, ne chimingichi gose ching’ondi, chibe ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa ase Nyasae o igoro. Boigo baegwe engano, na omonyoo, na edivai, na amaguta ’amasabibu. Baegwe ebinto ebio, tibamocha kobiegwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo mbanyare komoruera Nyasae o igoro ebing’wanso bikomogwenera, na gosabera obogima bwane, inche omorwoti, na obw’abamura baane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo nachiikire ng’a, monto onde bwensi oraonchore ring’ana eri, omwamba osomorwe korwa ase enyomba yaye, na ere omonyene atongwe ase oro, na enyomba yaye ekorwe ebe etui y’eubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga Nyasae, oyo obekire erieta riaye ribeere aroro, aonchore na koiyeria inse omorwoti onde bwensi, gose abanto, barateeme koonchora ogochika oko, gose gosaria enyomba eye ya Nyasae ere Yerusalemu. Inche Dario narure ogochika okwo, tiga koigwerwe kegima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hekalu egochenwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Tatenai, omogabana bw’orogongo rore bosongo y’orooche roria, na Setari‐Bosenai, na abarenge kogamba komo, bagakora ase okwerwa amang’ana ayio onsi Dario omorwoti konya achiikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagaaka b’Abayahudi bakagenderera koagacha na konyora ogosesenigwa goetera ase obobani bwa Hagai na Zakaria bw’ororeria rwa Ido. Igo abanto bagakoora emeremo y’oboagacho obwo buna bachigetwe na Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, na buna Koresi, na Dario, na Aritasasita, abarwoti b’Abaayemi bachigete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomba eria ekaagachwa ekaera ase rituko ria gatato ri’omotienyi okorokwa Adari, ase omwaka o gatano na rimo bw’okogamba kwa Dario, omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Abaisraeli: abakuani, na Abalawi, na abanto bande abwo bairanete korwa ase obosomba, bagakora omoyega omonene bw’omogooko ase ogwatanana enyomba eria ya Nyasae na koyechena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ase ogwatanana enyomba eye na koyechena, bakarua chieri rigana erimo, ne chimingichi amagana abere, ne chimanwa chimingichi chi’eching’ondi amagana ane, chikaba ebing’wanso. Boigo bakarua chigoree ikomi na ibere chikaba ebing’wanso bi’ebibe ase engencho y’Abaisraeli. Echio nigo chiaruetwe koreng’ana nomobaro bw’ebisaku bi’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo bakabeeka abakuani ase ebiombe biabo, na Abalawi ase emeremo yabo, ase okomokorera Nyasae agwo Yerusalemu, koreng’ana buna eriikire ase egetabu ya Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Epasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ria ikomi na kane ri’omotienyi bw’eritang’ani, abanto baria bairanete korwa ase obosomba bakarenda Epasaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuani na Abalawi konya bechenire; bono bonsi nigo barenge abachenegete. Ase ayio bakanyenya chimanwa chiria chi’eching’ondi chi’Epasaka ase engencho y’abwo bonsi bairanete korwa ase obosomba, na ase abakuani bamwabo, na ase barabwo abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinyama chie chimanwa chiria nigo chiarietwe n’Abaisraeli baria bairanete korwa ase obosomba, boigo na kera omonto bweatananete korwa ase ogosaria kw’abaanto b’ebisaku b’ense eria na kobwatana n’Abaisraeli ase ogosasiima Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere bakaba barendete Rituko riria Rinene ri’Emegati etabekiri memera bare nomogooko. Omonene nigo abarenterete omogooko oyio ase okoonchora enkoro y’omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, erinde akabancha akabakonya mono ase emeremo y’enyomba ya Nyasae oyore Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
